cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KAIROS in research, evaluation, or derivative work, please cite this repository."
title: "KAIROS: Temporal Analysis for Policy and Institutional Text"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Giulio
    family-names: Catanzariti
    affiliation: TACITUS
    email: hello@tacitus.me
repository-code: "https://github.com/sargonxg/KAIROS-temporal-vision-TACITUS"
url: "https://www.tacitus.me"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  KAIROS is an experimental Rust-first system for building source-grounded
  temporal knowledge graphs from policy, legal, diplomatic, and institutional
  text, including events, actors, commitments, episodes, uncertainty, and
  Allen-13 temporal relations.
keywords:
  - temporal reasoning
  - policy analysis
  - knowledge graphs
  - provenance
  - diplomacy
  - Rust
